{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTHookFormulaGeneral","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTHookFormulaGeneral","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTHookFormulaRows","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTHookFormulaBetaProd","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnumeration"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.dimAitkenIdentity_6","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.dimAitkenIdentity_6","kind":"theorem","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTHookFormulaGeneral.lean#L113-L116","doc":"**Aitken identity, `decide`-verified for every shape of `sz = 6` (sorry-free).**  Needs\n`maxRecDepth` raised for the `720`-deep structural permutation recursion in `numSYTenum`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.dimAitkenIdentity_5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.dimAitkenIdentity_5","kind":"theorem","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTHookFormulaGeneral.lean#L108-L110","doc":"**Aitken identity, `decide`-verified for every shape of `sz = 5` (sorry-free).** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.dimAitkenIdentity_le4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.dimAitkenIdentity_le4","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTHookFormulaGeneral.lean#L102-L106","doc":"**Aitken identity, `decide`-verified for every shape of `sz ≤ 4` (sorry-free).**  The exact\n`dimAitkenIdentity` equation on a closed shape is a decidable `ℕ` computation; this discharges it for\nall `sz ≤ 4` directly from the brute-force `numSYTenum`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.betaProdGap_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.betaProdGap_pos","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTHookFormulaGeneral.lean#L76-L83","doc":"**The Vandermonde product is positive (sorry-free).** Each beta-gap factor is `≥ 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.prodHooks_mul_betaProdGap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.prodHooks_mul_betaProdGap","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTHookFormulaGeneral.lean#L68-L74","doc":"**(i) hook side, general `n` (sorry-free), in the named form.**\n`prodHooks l · betaProdGap l = betaFactProd l` — the Frame–Robinson–Thrall hook product cleared of its\nVandermonde denominator.  A thin renaming of `prodHooks_mul_betaGapProd`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.betaFactProd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.betaFactProd","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTHookFormulaGeneral.lean#L63-L66","doc":"The beta-factorial product `∏_i β_i! = ∏_i (l[i] + (l.drop (i+1)).length)!`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.betaProdGap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.betaProdGap","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTHookFormulaGeneral.lean#L58-L61","doc":"The Vandermonde product `∏_{i<j}(β_i − β_j) = ∏_i betaGapProd (l[i]) (l.drop (i+1))`, in\ndivisor-free recursion-matched form. ","signatureChunk":0}]}